WEBVTT

00:05.050 --> 00:06.050
Mike.

00:06.090 --> 00:09.260
Both the White House and the Pentagon
have been taken over.

00:09.300 --> 00:10.430
What?!

00:10.760 --> 00:12.550
And that's not all,

00:12.600 --> 00:15.770
the AUZA Reactor plant Joseph was
threatening to blow up was also invaded.

00:15.930 --> 00:17.810
Based on what eyewitnesses have said,

00:17.850 --> 00:20.600
it seems likely the ninjas
are behind it all.

00:20.900 --> 00:22.360
Hold the phone!

00:22.400 --> 00:26.070
Are you saying Joseph was gonna blow up
a place that the ninjas were occupying?!

00:26.320 --> 00:28.070
We're still gathering intel.

00:28.110 --> 00:31.280
Right now, I need you to stay focused
on trailing Joseph.

00:31.660 --> 00:32.820
Roger that.

00:34.200 --> 00:35.540
I'm sorry, Mike.

00:36.200 --> 00:38.700
We'll drink some good Japanese sake
when this is over.

00:38.750 --> 00:42.130
And I mean the best money can buy.
Made with Yamada-Nishiki rice.

00:42.170 --> 00:43.540
I'm holding you to that!

00:44.750 --> 00:47.170
Jeez, are they having
an internal feud or what?

00:50.720 --> 00:52.590
Jason! Have any luck?

00:52.640 --> 00:54.510
-I've found Joseph's hiding place.
-The government

00:54.550 --> 00:55.850
-The AUZA Palace Hotel.
-framed me!

00:55.890 --> 00:57.520
You were right on the money.

00:57.560 --> 01:00.350
It even comes complete
with an emergency escape route.

01:00.980 --> 01:02.980
From what I can tell,
the exit comes out at...

01:03.900 --> 01:05.770
Neal Avenue Station.

01:05.820 --> 01:07.650
That's a ghost station.

01:08.030 --> 01:10.700
Jason! I have one more favor to ask you!

01:12.240 --> 01:14.240
So, this was your plan all along?

01:14.990 --> 01:17.660
You gave us the impression
your power plants would help bolster

01:17.700 --> 01:19.290
our key government facilities.

01:19.330 --> 01:21.790
But in reality, you were creating
bases to host your forces

01:21.830 --> 01:24.000
so they could invade
those locations at any time.

01:24.500 --> 01:27.710
So what now?
Will you take over the country?

01:27.750 --> 01:28.590
No.

01:28.630 --> 01:31.920
Our objective remains the same
as when this all began.

01:32.300 --> 01:36.430
We shall bring peace to the world.
That is the duty of all ninjas.

01:36.970 --> 01:39.430
Really? You call this "peace"?

01:39.470 --> 01:43.060
Nothing will change if we simply try
to maintain the balance of power

01:43.100 --> 01:44.980
as we always have.

01:45.350 --> 01:48.690
There are just too many disparities
in ethnic groups, territory,

01:48.730 --> 01:51.070
resources, and religions.

01:51.110 --> 01:53.740
People can never escape
from the anger and greed

01:53.780 --> 01:55.660
that are born as a result of those.

01:56.200 --> 01:59.200
Thus, all of that shall be cast aside

01:59.240 --> 02:02.790
and we will become the ultimate power
who watches carefully over the world,

02:02.830 --> 02:05.370
punishing any who dare
to disturb the peace.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.170
The first step is for us

02:07.210 --> 02:10.250
to reach a platform where
we can declare this to everyone.

02:10.300 --> 02:12.340
So you think having
the help of our country

02:12.380 --> 02:14.550
is enough to cause
a global paradigm shift?

02:15.220 --> 02:19.260
We have completely commandeered
AUZA's technology and resources.

02:19.640 --> 02:22.390
That includes everything
related to energy as well.

02:23.430 --> 02:25.650
You've seized control of AUZA?!

02:25.690 --> 02:30.270
And at the present moment,
we are fully aware of Joseph's movements.

02:30.320 --> 02:33.440
We shall put an end to him in due time.

02:33.650 --> 02:37.200
Just as soon as we deal with
one last problem...

02:45.040 --> 02:47.170
I'm almost there.

02:47.460 --> 02:49.250
What's happening on your end?

02:50.210 --> 02:51.590
All right.

02:52.090 --> 02:53.050
Mike.

02:53.090 --> 02:54.170
Just a few minutes ago,

02:54.220 --> 02:58.470
the satellites caught sight of Joseph's
car headed north along Highway 86.

02:58.510 --> 03:00.260
Well, I'm driving along it right now!

03:00.680 --> 03:03.270
Where the hell is he
trying to go out here?

03:03.470 --> 03:07.400
Along that route there are
some grazing fields for pig farms and...

03:08.150 --> 03:09.690
one of AUZA's test sites!

03:09.900 --> 03:12.940
I'm sending our closest agents
that way right now.

03:12.980 --> 03:15.240
Make sure they keep a low profile.

03:15.740 --> 03:17.660
Come on, Emma!

03:17.700 --> 03:20.320
Everything's riding on
your hacking system now!

03:20.370 --> 03:21.490
Jason!

03:21.530 --> 03:23.330
Get out here and lend me a hand already!

03:23.370 --> 03:24.700
Gonna have to wait!

03:24.740 --> 03:28.120
I'm in the middle of moving
a satellite right now!

03:28.420 --> 03:31.340
It seems our pursuers
have headed for the test site, sir.

03:31.380 --> 03:32.420
Just as planned.

03:32.460 --> 03:35.300
Well, I suppose flying in a plane
with a bunch of pigs

03:35.340 --> 03:37.300
will at least make
for a unique experience.

03:39.180 --> 03:41.350
The next time I set foot in this country

03:41.390 --> 03:44.180
will be after the world
has been turned on its head!

03:54.820 --> 03:56.190
What's going on?

04:26.310 --> 04:27.890
Piss off, old man!

04:37.900 --> 04:39.150
Ow!

04:39.490 --> 04:40.490
Dammit!

04:45.660 --> 04:47.040
How'd you know to come here?

04:47.660 --> 04:49.910
Do this job for as long as I have

04:49.960 --> 04:52.170
and you hear a lot about
the shit that criminals try to pull.

04:53.750 --> 04:57.000
Like this one time I was chatting
with some guys from the Narc Squad,

04:57.050 --> 05:00.760
and they told me about a guy who
tried to smuggle drugs into the country

05:00.800 --> 05:03.840
by putting them in non-digestible
containers and feeding them to pigs!

05:05.300 --> 05:07.890
So I just followed my gut
and here we are.

05:08.680 --> 05:11.310
It's over now! Give up.

05:20.240 --> 05:21.200
Don't do it!

05:35.170 --> 05:36.420
What the hell?!

05:36.460 --> 05:38.460
Howd'ya like them apples!

05:42.840 --> 05:44.800
A jamming signal, huh?

05:45.510 --> 05:47.350
You two really are...

05:47.930 --> 05:49.430
the greatest of all time.

05:55.650 --> 05:58.520
I'll admit you may be
some kind of genius.

05:58.820 --> 06:02.700
That being said, if a washed-up cop
like me can catch you,

06:02.740 --> 06:05.240
then you were bound to come
to a dead end sooner or later.

06:06.820 --> 06:11.250
The word "dead end"
simply doesn't exist in my vocabulary...

06:11.660 --> 06:14.120
Small mistakes are unavoidable
on the path to progress.

06:14.250 --> 06:16.080
"Small mistakes," huh?

06:16.130 --> 06:18.790
Getting thrown in the slammer
doesn't seem so small to me.

06:19.040 --> 06:21.630
Do you realize just how many
people out in the world

06:21.670 --> 06:24.130
are desperate for my expertise?

06:24.970 --> 06:27.220
I'll be free in no time at all.

06:27.260 --> 06:28.390
Anyway,

06:28.430 --> 06:32.480
the real mistake I made was not
killing you when I had the chance.

06:32.980 --> 06:34.730
If things had gone as planned,

06:34.770 --> 06:37.270
then you would have been blown to
smithereens with those stupid ninjas.

06:38.520 --> 06:39.940
But that's fine.

06:40.650 --> 06:42.610
This game would be boring as hell

06:42.650 --> 06:44.740
without a few pesky enemies
to stand in my way.

07:10.350 --> 07:12.600
The real reason
you didn't die back then...

07:12.640 --> 07:15.520
wasn't because of
your secret art, was it?

07:16.770 --> 07:18.060
It was Mari.

07:18.100 --> 07:19.860
I'm living on borrowed time
thanks to her.

07:20.520 --> 07:23.030
The deep desire
that we ninjas have harbored

07:23.070 --> 07:27.780
for over 600 long years
is now on the verge of becoming reality.

07:27.820 --> 07:31.370
Surely you understand
the significance of that, Higan.

07:31.740 --> 07:34.790
It has nothing to do with me anymore.

07:35.200 --> 07:36.500
The only reason I'm here

07:36.540 --> 07:40.420
is to put an end to the cycle
of tragedy that you've given rise to.

07:41.000 --> 07:43.340
This is the end of the ninja.

07:43.590 --> 07:46.340
The ninja will never die.

07:46.670 --> 07:50.260
Everything about the clan
will soon be exposed to the world.

07:50.300 --> 07:53.100
You won't be able to
live in the shadows any longer.

07:55.060 --> 07:57.850
It seems you don't understand
the situation at all.

07:58.020 --> 08:01.190
I'm intentionally bringing
the ninjas into the light.

08:01.230 --> 08:03.980
Because our great cause can never
come to fruition in the shadows.

08:04.320 --> 08:07.360
We'll prove to everyone across the globe
that they are powerless before us,

08:07.400 --> 08:10.700
then use our authority
to keep the world at peace.

08:11.200 --> 08:13.620
Right. And how's that going for you?

08:15.080 --> 08:17.830
These are not the circumstances
I had hoped for.

08:17.870 --> 08:19.580
That's why I have come...

08:20.830 --> 08:24.130
to bring everything to a close with this.

09:59.850 --> 10:00.930
Zai!

10:05.850 --> 10:06.940
Higan.

10:07.560 --> 10:11.530
The life of a ninja...
is the only one that I can live!

10:29.880 --> 10:33.420
The quiet lake gleams in the morning sun,

10:33.470 --> 10:36.050
with nary a ripple
from any boats to be found.

10:40.100 --> 10:42.520
Secret art: Serenity!

10:48.400 --> 10:50.900
So, this is your secret art, eh?

10:56.410 --> 11:00.530
Did you honestly think this would
be enough for you to bring me down?

11:01.740 --> 11:05.580
You can watch our great cause
come to fruition from the depths of Hell!

11:06.000 --> 11:09.420
In this life ordained
by the gods above...

11:09.790 --> 11:14.260
His secret art can tamper with
his opponent's mind.

11:14.470 --> 11:18.010
...whom else but you
could make me wish for longevity!

11:18.220 --> 11:21.100
Perish together for the sake
of our great cause.

11:21.560 --> 11:23.770
Secret art: God's Will.

11:35.650 --> 11:40.820
If you ask me,
our bonds are thicker than blood.

11:41.160 --> 11:45.040
We risk our lives together,
to do what must be done.

11:45.290 --> 11:46.830
We made a pact...

11:47.710 --> 11:49.710
to put our lives in each other's hands!

11:51.130 --> 11:53.460
I gotta say, this feels pretty weird

11:53.800 --> 11:56.970
Being a ninja is the only way
I know how to live.

11:57.010 --> 12:00.010
But now I'm going
to have to become a father.

12:00.470 --> 12:03.220
Do you think I can handle it?

12:03.430 --> 12:06.810
You're not alone,
we'll be parents together.

12:09.020 --> 12:11.150
Daddy...

12:31.670 --> 12:32.920
Daddy!

12:43.010 --> 12:45.720
Why didn't you save us?

12:45.760 --> 12:48.390
I'm sorry... I'm sorry...

13:01.240 --> 13:03.370
Mari... Ren...

13:03.910 --> 13:05.240
I'm sorry...

13:06.620 --> 13:09.450
We have fought on behalf
of the greater good

13:09.500 --> 13:14.000
and ended up losing our way
after suffering countless betrayals.

13:14.210 --> 13:16.670
However, the ninja way will change.

13:17.000 --> 13:19.670
There is now a clear path
for us to the future

13:19.720 --> 13:21.630
and I will not allow you to block it!

13:21.800 --> 13:23.840
What do you mean by "future"?

13:24.390 --> 13:26.010
I'm not entirely sure yet.

13:26.390 --> 13:29.140
But someday,
I think I'll figure that out.

13:30.270 --> 13:31.890
Then perhaps that is...

13:34.480 --> 13:37.440
I am going to make sure
you die this time,

13:37.480 --> 13:40.400
as you experience
the cruelest fate imaginable.

13:45.950 --> 13:47.580
Farewell.

13:58.250 --> 13:59.670
I knew it...

13:59.710 --> 14:03.340
Your heart was tainted
by the need for friends deep down!

14:10.640 --> 14:11.640
Zai!

14:36.670 --> 14:38.670
Why do you reject peace?

14:39.090 --> 14:41.590
Are you just that desperate for a fight?

14:41.630 --> 14:45.380
You can never achieve peace by
relying solely on the might of the ninja!

14:46.090 --> 14:50.390
Then what solution do you have to offer?!
Tell me, Higan!

15:12.040 --> 15:15.250
You were unable to persevere
on the path of the ninja

15:15.660 --> 15:19.040
and you offer no justification
for abandoning our great cause.

15:19.080 --> 15:22.420
You'll never understand the bladed heart
of a shinobi such as I!

15:23.960 --> 15:25.920
You're nothing but a lowly worm!

15:25.970 --> 15:29.300
And you'll never have
what it takes to cut me down!

15:30.970 --> 15:34.850
Now behold, for this is
the power that I wield!

15:56.870 --> 15:59.290
Let me be crystal clear.

15:59.670 --> 16:01.210
If my desire fails to be granted now,

16:01.250 --> 16:04.550
then it means all hope
for the world is dead!

16:16.140 --> 16:17.560
Mari...

16:18.190 --> 16:21.150
This is the end of the road for me...

16:22.150 --> 16:26.990
Why is that?
Your spirit is still brimming with life.

16:27.490 --> 16:29.820
Whether its fraught
with hatred and anger,

16:29.860 --> 16:32.490
or immersed in grief and despair,

16:32.530 --> 16:35.330
the fragile human heart
is quick to shatter.

16:35.370 --> 16:37.120
But that's not true of yours.

16:37.160 --> 16:39.710
Because you've already overcome
all of that, right?

16:40.870 --> 16:43.670
Remember what my ninja philosophy is.

16:43.920 --> 16:47.760
Be as cold as fire, and as hot as ice...

16:48.340 --> 16:50.380
by forging your mind.

17:07.320 --> 17:11.490
This suit responds
directly to the will of its user.

17:11.860 --> 17:17.870
Be cold as fire and as hot as ice
by forging your mind.

17:18.160 --> 17:21.500
And that... will become your weapon!

17:23.880 --> 17:27.670
Even in the face of lightning
that tears the heavens apart...

17:28.340 --> 17:29.420
Impossible!

17:29.630 --> 17:31.380
That's my secret art!

17:31.680 --> 17:34.390
...there is no greater majesty
than today.

17:34.680 --> 17:38.060
But each ninja should only
have been bestowed one secret art!

17:40.020 --> 17:41.940
Secret Art: Thunderclap!

18:12.510 --> 18:13.510
He is the embodiment of...

18:14.180 --> 18:15.470
a shinobi!

19:18.280 --> 19:19.660
Know this.

19:19.910 --> 19:22.200
There are other ninja who...

19:23.250 --> 19:25.750
will carry on my duty.

19:26.580 --> 19:31.500
Even if I perish here, our great cause
shall come to fruition in the end.

19:48.190 --> 19:49.850
Mark my words.

19:53.360 --> 19:55.690
There will never be peace in this world

19:55.740 --> 19:59.950
so long as we have to
rely on other people for it...

20:04.740 --> 20:06.830
You did your own fair share

20:06.870 --> 20:09.290
of snuffing out peace for other people.

20:10.460 --> 20:12.880
And as I see it,
the only fact that matters...

20:13.840 --> 20:15.050
is that one.

20:31.350 --> 20:34.190
Hey, asshole! You made me bump my head!

20:48.200 --> 20:49.960
Get out of prison all you want.

20:50.710 --> 20:52.540
'Cuz every time you do,

20:52.830 --> 20:55.460
I'm gonna come punch you
in the goddamn face.

20:55.840 --> 20:57.800
You piece of shit.

21:02.050 --> 21:02.840
Hey!

21:02.890 --> 21:04.430
We got word all the government offices

21:04.470 --> 21:06.260
that were taken over
have just been set free!

21:06.310 --> 21:08.890
Are you serious? How did that happen?

21:08.930 --> 21:11.730
Uh, well, the details
aren't really clear at the moment...

21:14.310 --> 21:17.820
Duck pulled it off,
that glorious bastard.

21:36.500 --> 21:37.590
Zai!

21:37.960 --> 21:39.170
Let go!

21:39.210 --> 21:41.840
Any ninja who attacks
their own chieftain deserves this!

21:41.880 --> 21:43.760
It's over, there are no more ninja!

21:59.190 --> 22:00.320
Listen.

22:01.070 --> 22:03.570
It dawned on me I've been kept alive
by a chain of sentiments

22:03.610 --> 22:05.910
that were shared
between different people.

22:06.910 --> 22:08.450
And that's true of you, too.

22:08.910 --> 22:10.580
Now we both have the responsibility

22:10.620 --> 22:14.040
to live in search of a way
to repay those people.

22:14.500 --> 22:16.210
And honor their memory.

22:25.050 --> 22:26.590
Are you saying that...

22:27.300 --> 22:31.180
there's still a path
left for me to follow?

22:37.060 --> 22:39.690
There's more than one place
for us to live our lives.

22:52.290 --> 22:53.710
And no matter where you go...

22:54.410 --> 22:56.750
you're sure to find new horizons waiting.
